The omatel binaries link these Rust crates statically, each under its own
license: zbus and zvariant (MIT), gtk4, gdk4, gsk4, glib, gio, libadwaita
and the other gtk-rs crates (MIT), rusqlite (MIT), phonenumber
(Apache-2.0), tokio (MIT), chrono (MIT OR Apache-2.0), serde and
serde_json (MIT OR Apache-2.0), and the crates listed in Cargo.lock. They
link GTK and libadwaita (LGPL-2.1-or-later) and SQLite (public domain)
dynamically.
